# This workflow holds no secrets of its own — everything lives in n8n's credential store.
# Listed here so the values you need are in one place.
#
# In n8n: Credentials > New > Supabase API
#   Host                 https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
#   Service Role Secret  your Supabase service_role key   <- bypasses RLS, server-side only
#
# In the three Discord post nodes, replace the placeholder URL:
#   https://discord.com/api/webhooks/REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-WEBHOOK
#
# Never paste real values into nightly-markdown-review.json before committing it.
